{"id":86,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"86:1","text":"以穷苍和启明星盟誓，"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"86:2","text":"你怎能知道启明星是什麽？"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"86:3","text":"是那灿烂的明星。"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"86:4","text":"每个人，都有一个保护者。"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"86:5","text":"人应当想一想，他自己是用什麽造成的？"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"86:6","text":"他是射出的精液造成的。"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"86:7","text":"那精液是从脊柱和肋骨之间发出的。"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"86:8","text":"真主确是能使他复原的，"},{"verseNumber":9,"verseKey":"86:9","text":"那是在一切秘密被揭穿之日。"},{"verseNumber":10,"verseKey":"86:10","text":"他绝没有能力，也没有援助者。"},{"verseNumber":11,"verseKey":"86:11","text":"以含雨的云"},{"verseNumber":12,"verseKey":"86:12","text":"和有缝的地发誓，"},{"verseNumber":13,"verseKey":"86:13","text":"这确是分别真伪的言辞，"},{"verseNumber":14,"verseKey":"86:14","text":"这不是笑话。"},{"verseNumber":15,"verseKey":"86:15","text":"他们必定要用计谋，"},{"verseNumber":16,"verseKey":"86:16","text":"我也要用计谋。"},{"verseNumber":17,"verseKey":"86:17","text":"所以你当宽限不信道的人们，你当宽限他们一下。"}]}